WEBVTT

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:33.714
JM: My boss really was the one
that sort of put in my head,

00:20:33.738 --> 00:20:36.612
"You really need to make sure
you're taking care of yourself

00:20:36.636 --> 00:20:38.416
and doing what's best for you."

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:41.356
And it just so happened she was right.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:45.006
AG: There's evidence that self-care
isn't just important for health.

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.291
It's critical to maintaining
energy and performance, too.

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.016
Accenture encouraged
Joanne to care for herself

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.306
as much as she did her job.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.630
Joanne realized she needed
to make a change.

00:20:55.654 --> 00:20:57.576
And once she returned to the office,

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.261
people around her noticed a new Joanne.